        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Work Where the Good Drinks Are</h2>
        <p>Monarch Liquor is a father-and-son shop that grew into two of the friendliest liquor stores in Austin. We're small enough that everyone's ideas matter and big enough to keep you busy. Our people know their regulars by name, geek out about new Texas distilleries, and take pride in a well-organized beer cave.</p>
        <p>If you love great drinks, great service, and a workplace that treats you like family, we'd love to meet you.</p>
