        <div class="step-card reveal">
          <svg class="icon icon--store" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-store"/></svg>
          <h3>Sales Associate</h3>
          <p>Front of house at either store: helping customers find their new favorite bottle, stocking shelves, and running the register. Must be 21+. TABC seller training a plus &mdash; we'll help you get certified if not.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card reveal">
          <svg class="icon icon--truck" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-truck"/></svg>
          <h3>Delivery Driver</h3>
          <p>Bring the best delivery this side of the Colorado to doorsteps across Austin and Lakeway. Clean driving record and 21+ required. Great for people who like being out and about.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card reveal">
          <svg class="icon icon--key" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-key"/></svg>
          <h3>Shift Lead</h3>
          <p>Open and close the store, lead a small team, and keep the day running smoothly. Retail experience preferred, 21+ and TABC training a plus.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

